      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "YAMATO SATONA (3) is one of the more interesting runners at the meeting, having his first start in Aus after coming from NZ. Was G2-placed over 2000m over there and won his maiden at 1400m, so 1600m here looks perfect off a nice recent Caulfield trial. ZORRO'S FLIGHT (4) is racing well, scoring two back at this track before finishing 2 lengths from the winner in second last time over 1400m at Mildura. Sure to go well. NEARING LIBERTY (2) finished 8 lengths adrift in 10th last time at Sandown in a disappointing performance. Finds a suitable assignment and can get the job done. RASP (1) has had a productive prep, winning three times, the past two on Heavy ground so if he strikes those kind of conditions again he's a major player. CEREMONIOUS (6) was safely held when 12th last time out over 2125m at Sandown-Lakeside, beaten 6 lengths, after a win at Geelong at the previous outing. Likely improver with top-three prospects.",
